The second warning message "In addTelemetry(CHBM, CHt, type = c("dependent"), collapsetelemetry = TRUE,  : covariates in telemetryCH do not match detectionCH so covariates discarded"  I have resolved using the following code:
covariates(CHtsingle_nom6) <- data.frame(sex = covariates(CHBM)$sex[match(rownames(CHtsingle_nom6),rownames(CHBM))])
