Ben's explanation makes a lot of sense to me. The informative dataset is possibly very thin (7 individuals and few re-detections except repeats at initial sites?) coupled with small array relative to natural movements. The bk model alerts us to some difficult biology that probably invalidates the null model estimate, without providing a solution.
Murray

