>
> This plot would suggest to me that the bk model is not identifiable with these data. If I'm understanding your suggestion correctly, this behaviour is likely a result of the trapping array being too small relative to the scale of individual movement in conjunction with the order of magnitude drop in g0 in trap happy models (bk). Does that seem plausible?
